{"id":"b191494d56cdc254","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-flat-source.md","title":"平坦弱随机源","display":"df-flat-source — 平坦弱随机源","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-df-flat-source","aliases":["28-df-flat-source"],"display":"df-flat-source — 平坦弱随机源","depends_on":["[[28-df-ppt]]","[[28-df-min-entropy]]"],"source_book_location":"Proof of Theorem 21.25","source_printed_pages":"444","source_pdf_pages":"470","source_status":"statement-compared-local-formalization","source_proof_reviewed":false,"eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"revision":"R5","verification_status":"definition-or-example-statement-compared"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-flat-source"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-flat-source</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-flat-source — 平坦弱随机源"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b75200f005282ddf\" href=\"?note=b75200f005282ddf\" title=\"28-df-ppt\">28-df-ppt</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"f79df9244d067310\" href=\"?note=f79df9244d067310\" title=\"28-df-min-entropy\">28-df-min-entropy</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_book_location","html":"Proof of Theorem 21.25"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"444"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"470"},{"key":"source_status","html":"statement-compared-local-formalization"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"false"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"revision","html":"R5"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"definition-or-example-statement-compared"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\{0,\\ldots,n\\}\">\\(k\\in\\{0,\\ldots,n\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Dist}\">\\(\\operatorname{Dist}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Source}_{n,k}\">\\(\\operatorname{Source}_{n,k}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b75200f005282ddf\" href=\"?note=b75200f005282ddf\" title=\"28-df-ppt\">28-df-ppt</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"f79df9244d067310\" href=\"?note=f79df9244d067310\" title=\"28-df-min-entropy\">28-df-min-entropy</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\{0,1\\}^n\">\\(A\\subseteq\\{0,1\\}^n\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf1_A(x)\">\\(\\mathbf1_A(x)\\)</span> 为集合指示函数。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Flat}_{n,k}\\coloneqq\\{p\\in\\operatorname{Dist}(\\{0,1\\}^n):\\exists A\\subseteq\\{0,1\\}^n\\;(|A|=2^k\\land\\forall x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\;p(x)=2^{-k}\\mathbf1_A(x))\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Flat}_{n,k}\\coloneqq\\{p\\in\\operatorname{Dist}(\\{0,1\\}^n):\\exists A\\subseteq\\{0,1\\}^n\\;(|A|=2^k\\land\\forall x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\;p(x)=2^{-k}\\mathbf1_A(x))\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Flat}_{n,k}\\subseteq\\operatorname{Source}_{n,k}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Flat}_{n,k}\\subseteq\\operatorname{Source}_{n,k}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>k 取整数以保证 2^k 是子集基数；不能直接将实数熵参数用于此平坦源定义。有限集合上的均匀质量函数存在且唯一。k=0 为点质量，k=n 为全域均匀分布。</p>\n<p>来源：所给 Arora–Barak PDF，Proof of Theorem 21.25；印刷页 444；PDF 页 470。</p>\n<p>R7复核：Theorem 21.25证明（PDF470）的平坦源是2^k元支持上的均匀质量函数；定义中的x量词限定到n比特输入域。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-ppt","status":"resolved","id":"b75200f005282ddf","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-ppt]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-min-entropy","status":"resolved","id":"f79df9244d067310","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-min-entropy]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-ppt","status":"resolved","id":"b75200f005282ddf","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$k\\in\\{0,\\ldots,n\\}$；$\\operatorname{Dist}$、$\\operatorname{Source}_{n,k}$ 见 [[28-df-ppt]]、[[28-df-min-entropy]]。$A\\subseteq\\{0,1\\}^n$，$\\mathbf1_A(x)$ 为集合指示函数。","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-min-entropy","status":"resolved","id":"f79df9244d067310","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$k\\in\\{0,\\ldots,n\\}$；$\\operatorname{Dist}$、$\\operatorname{Source}_{n,k}$ 见 [[28-df-ppt]]、[[28-df-min-entropy]]。$A\\subseteq\\{0,1\\}^n$，$\\mathbf1_A(x)$ 为集合指示函数。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"k\\in\\{0,\\ldots,n\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Dist}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Source}_{n,k}","display":false},{"tex":"A\\subseteq\\{0,1\\}^n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf1_A(x)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Flat}_{n,k}\\coloneqq\\{p\\in\\operatorname{Dist}(\\{0,1\\}^n):\\exists A\\subseteq\\{0,1\\}^n\\;(|A|=2^k\\land\\forall x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\;p(x)=2^{-k}\\mathbf1_A(x))\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Flat}_{n,k}\\subseteq\\operatorname{Source}_{n,k}.","display":true}],"bytes":1570,"backlinks":[{"id":"8aebe42487aca071","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$k\\in\\{0,\\ldots,n\\}$，$p\\in\\operatorname{Source}_{n,k}$ 见 [[28-df-min-entropy]]；$\\operatorname{Flat}_{n,k}$ 见 [[28-df-flat-source]]。"},{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-389","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[28-df-graph-power]]、[[28-df-graph-tensor-product]]、[[28-df-replacement-product]]、[[28-thm-tensor-product-expansion]]、[[28-thm-replacement-product-expansion]]、[[28-df-flat-source]]、[[28-lem-flat-source-convex-decomposition]]、[[28-df-branching-program]]、[[28-df-undirected-connectivity]]、[[28-thm-reingold]]、[[28-df-space-bounded-prg]]、[[28-thm-nisan-space-prg]]。"}],"outgoing":["b75200f005282ddf","f79df9244d067310"]}